      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "怨气冲天的矿工",
            "content": "看到这标志没，这操作台是太阳谷工业淘汰的上一代老型号，稍微一操作，那钻头就轰隆作响。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_005_agmineb",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "mineb",
              "animationName": "Skill",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "怨气冲天的矿工",
            "content": "也不知道哪个黑心仓管为了点钱就把这种东西卖给那对老夫妇。虽说太阳谷工业淘汰下来的东西也不至于旧到没法用，但是......",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_005_agmineb",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "怨气冲天的矿工",
            "content": "那麦尼尔先生说，要我今天之内“赌上我在行业里的名声”把这个操作台校准得无比精确，下钻头要保证一次成功。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_005_agmineb",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "怨气冲天的矿工",
            "content": "呵，呵呵。我看，他就是想毁了我的名声。事到如今，我不知道还能做什么来稳住这台机子。就这样吧。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_005_agmineb",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "平台上的设施落后也是很现实的问题呢......",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "unit_animation",
          "data": {
            "id": "amly",
            "animationName": "Smile",
            "pauseOnEnd": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "我......可能知道一个方法能帮到你。如果你需要的话，我可以示范怎么做。",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "阿梅利亚",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4236_tmslot",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "怨气冲天的矿工",
            "content": "你是？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_005_agmineb",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "别看她年轻，阿梅可是厉害的工程师哦。她接连修好了两座通讯塔呢！",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "怨气冲天的矿工",
            "content": "那有救了！请指教，到底要怎么才能让机器配合一点？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_005_agmineb",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "说不上“指教”啦......只是一些个人的小心得，在实践中发现确实管用......但不保证在这里也......",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "阿梅利亚",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4236_tmslot_ashamed_angry",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "amly",
              "animationName": "Interact",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "怨气冲天的矿工",
            "content": "好好好，明白，谦虚的客套话不用说了。请——",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_005_agmineb",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "信号！全通畅！线路！全稳定！老板！全肯定！拜托了拜托了！！！",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "阿梅利亚",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4236_tmslot",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
